	quest.019BC15AC6DDE1C3.title: "Chainmail Armour"
	quest.02EE099947329F04.quest_desc: ["When it starts to brew you'll hear it! Keep an eye on your brewing station so that you can fix any issues. Red particles? Add more redstone. Water disappear? Add more water. Water fill up? Take some out. It's really that simple. You'll know when it's done."]
	quest.02F3D6FA329B8B3B.quest_subtitle: "Where else would you start?"
	quest.02F3D6FA329B8B3B.title: "A New Beginning"
	quest.03075CC90A5C5230.title: "Leather Armour"
	quest.050323AD07A87496.quest_desc: ["These are rare hats. Some of the ones in this section are actually holiday hats, however they are rated rare."]
	quest.0555F40EF9F5F45D.quest_desc: ["Well... I'd usually offer to buy the first round, but hey, with all the crops you've been farming, the drinks are on you!"]
	quest.068AD16EDDD39509.quest_desc: ["You're definitely going to need these to cook some new meals!"]
	quest.0BB6749BAA5BFE4C.quest_desc: ["And you've got oolong!"]
	quest.0CF878CFDA2C88B6.quest_desc: ["You'll need these to start!"]
	quest.0CF878CFDA2C88B6.title: "Tools"
	quest.1060E4EE13109952.quest_desc: ["Someone's moving quickly! Using your new prudentium ingots and gemstones you can upgrade that old inferium gear!"]
	quest.1060E4EE13109952.title: "Tier 2"
	quest.128A16CC1BF575BE.quest_desc: ["Time to kick back and relax! Stick a parasol in the sand and roll out your towel, lets do Beachparty!"]
	quest.173E87733C6248C9.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to our beautiful spawn!"
		""
		"We have worked hard over a few months to bring you the second season of our lovely server. Don't worry, this will be the only time we reset, as it allows us to update to 1.21.1, giving us not only more options in modding, but Trial Chambers as well!"
	]
	quest.173E87733C6248C9.title: "Pixel Springs"
	quest.17A768C2DAEF1B9D.quest_desc: ["No tools needed this time! Slice some bread, toast it up, and use some of the spreads you made last chapter!"]
	quest.1E5F43FFA4CB439B.quest_desc: ["You're going to need these ones to get started here."]
	quest.1E5F43FFA4CB439B.title: "Tools"
	quest.217FD5740505C0BF.quest_desc: ["Once it dries into a dried tea block... leave it to dry again."]
	quest.22FADA33B953A236.title: "Wooden Tools"
	quest.240ABDBD3A6C2634.quest_desc: ["To make a majority of the items in this mod you won't be crafting. You will need to make and place these items so that you can move on to the next part."]
	quest.240ABDBD3A6C2634.title: "Infusing"
	quest.2806C7BE663C9299.quest_desc: ["Well, you've done it. All you need to do now is upgrade your gear, and then you'll have the highest grade you're able to make in this mod. With a full set of Awakened Supremium armour you'll even be able to unlock the ability to fly. I'll leave you to figure that one out on your own..."]
	quest.2806C7BE663C9299.title: "Tier 6"
	quest.2AAABDCC99054220.quest_desc: ["Now, Lets do Brewery can be one of the more difficult mods. That is thanks to a lack of explanation on how it works. "]
	quest.2C8869327C3E943A.quest_desc: ["You'll want one of these too, maybe more than one. These make your inferium stronger, but each cystal has only 1000 uses, so you'll want to make a Master infusion crystal later on."]
	quest.2C8869327C3E943A.title: "Don't Forget"
	quest.2E8209A9BCA1E5CB.quest_desc: ["To Start your journey to completing mystic agriculture you are going to need Prosperity shards and Inferium essence. You will find a ton of it early on, and I promise you, if you don't collect it, you'll regret it down the line. This stuff is IMPORTANT!"]
	quest.2E8209A9BCA1E5CB.title: "To Begin With"
	quest.3376E137B0813DA3.quest_desc: ["These are epic hats. Some of the ones in this section are actually holiday hats, however they are rated epic."]
	quest.337E2639D0326A57.title: "Netherite Armour"
	quest.3727B152057ED601.quest_desc: ["You've done it! With the first tier of ingots and gemstones unlocked you can work towards making some much nicer armour and tools!"]
	quest.3727B152057ED601.title: "Tier 1"
	quest.37AB0BB5377FF4FD.quest_desc: ["Use green tea and black tea to craft mixed tea blocks. Once again, leave it out to dry."]
	quest.3BB9282D67A38B39.title: "Setting the Table"
	quest.3E7284AD57BC551F.quest_desc: [
		"You made it! To the Overworld! Okay, so that's not exactly &odifficult &rper se..."
		""
		"The rest of this chapter isn't really difficult either, they're just hidden. "
	]
	quest.4406B4069C8CA16A.quest_desc: ["Now, to get this last tier of armour and tools you'll need awakened supremium. Unlike the last ones, you cant simply upgrade your essence with a crystal, you'll need to awaken it using a new altar."]
	quest.4406B4069C8CA16A.title: "Awakening"
	quest.465715EFE5E8A22A.quest_desc: ["Your gear is getting pretty strong now. You might want to consider putting some augments on them. For now though, let's keep upgrading."]
	quest.465715EFE5E8A22A.title: "Tier 4"
	quest.4ADC1BC2680DA664.quest_desc: ["You'll need a few tools to start baking!"]
	quest.4ADC1BC2680DA664.title: "Tools"
	quest.4E0EF682F7D55857.quest_desc: [
		"You're going to need some water, buckets, coal, and redstone for this. I know that sounds like a lot, but that is because brewing is a whole minigame."
		""
		"You'll need to put redstone in the gauge, coal in the burner, ingredients in the brewing stand, and then fill it up with water."
	]
	quest.5092DAB0DDA18184.quest_desc: ["You're gonna need these... you'll probably need some tea too."]
	quest.5092DAB0DDA18184.title: "Brewing"
	quest.54753F57B080A510.quest_desc: ["You'll need some special counters to bake your cakes on. "]
	quest.54753F57B080A510.title: "Interior Design"
	quest.5611455C2D78F210.title: "Diamond Tools"
	quest.56916C32692EABDB.title: "Stone Tools"
	quest.570EB046CBF852F2.quest_desc: ["As this is a forever world, we take player interactions very seriously. If anyone does anything you believe is rude, hurtful, or generally out of line, please let an Admin or Moderator know. Your experience on our server is important to us, and we want people to get along."]
	quest.58E1C4173F18077C.title: "Serving Guests"
	quest.5A246AA59762C468.quest_desc: ["Time for another upgrade! Use your tertium to give that old prudentium gear a boost!"]
	quest.5A246AA59762C468.title: "Tier 3"
	quest.5A31F64541865C11.quest_desc: ["I told you that you'll need a lot! These three items are in almost every recipe in this mod. The gems and ingots will be used to make your tools, and the seeds will help you grow the vanilla items that you'll want to build later on."]
	quest.5A31F64541865C11.title: "The Next Step"
	quest.5ABB133AA17CE724.quest_desc: ["These are uncommon hats. Some of the ones in this section are actually holiday hats, however they are rated uncommmon."]
	quest.5B680D0EE51E8AFD.quest_desc: ["I don't know if you'll even make these. Most of you will move from diamond to Mystic agriculture, so there's really no need for netherite."]
	quest.5B7229A2FA339BE9.quest_desc: ["Yep, I did it again, make a whole set of golden armour."]
	quest.5B774DBB4DFEAA18.title: "Iron Tools"
	quest.5BFE47FF786293D5.title: "Beach Sports"
	quest.608D9482A6C302AE.quest_desc: ["Before you leave and begin your journey across the land, please take a moment to check out the whole spawn building. Just outside of the room you have spawned in, you will find corridoors to the outside world, along with large signs explaining server rules."]
	quest.610296C83ACA7CDC.quest_desc: ["Now you have black tea."]
	quest.671089F5B39375F9.quest_desc: [
		"When you're having fun! "
		""
		""
		"You're having fun... right?"
	]
	quest.67B44FB3E7420A80.quest_desc: [
		"Hope you still have some of the fruit you've grown for the other quests. It's time to bake pies."
		""
		"What flavour? Pie Flavour!"
	]
	quest.6A45C6D3403B60B2.quest_desc: ["This is the last set of gear you will be making in the infusion altar. Upgrade your gear to Supremium and get ready for the most tedious part of this mod."]
	quest.6A45C6D3403B60B2.title: "Tier 5"
	quest.6A8AD24A8FF2E322.quest_desc: ["You'll need some dough to bake your treats."]
	quest.6A8AD24A8FF2E322.title: "Ingredients"
	quest.6C5E29B0FEDD3758.quest_desc: ["You can't just throw a nicely decorated cake anywhere! Make yourself some display stands to stock your personal bakery."]
	quest.6C5E29B0FEDD3758.title: "Ways to Display"
	quest.6D7C2C10E48D3AC8.quest_desc: ["Dude... put them back."]
	quest.6D7C2C10E48D3AC8.quest_subtitle: "What?"
	quest.6E7D2B955928C964.quest_desc: ["These are common hats. Some of the ones in this section are actually holiday hats, however they are rated commmon."]
	quest.6F5C437DB9EC5898.quest_desc: ["Take some time out of your busy schedule and take a seat to enjoy your freshly baked treats!"]
	quest.6F5C437DB9EC5898.title: "Outdoor Seating"
	quest.70A487C3C6B50860.quest_desc: ["Hops is the base of most of the alcohol in this mod."]
	quest.74AA1ED732F70E04.quest_desc: ["I've given you one of these to start so you don't need to make one of these yourself."]
	quest.74D03781F58137AD.title: "Iron Armour"
	quest.76618194FC990A95.quest_desc: ["That's right, I'm adding golden tools as a requirement. I am forcing you all to make a full set."]
	quest.76618194FC990A95.title: "Golden Tools"
	quest.7807BC14553863D4.quest_desc: ["Get out there and have fun!"]
	quest.795D224F849F58F3.quest_desc: ["Yeah, we put this in the sandwich chapter. Forward any and all complaints to Admin Reminiscent36."]
	quest.7B1F2B037D782DF1.quest_desc: ["Wow... it feels like every mod has it's own tools. Oh well, you'll need these."]
	quest.7B1F2B037D782DF1.title: "Tools"
	quest.7C2C0C2A949CEEB9.quest_desc: ["Make yourself a block of tea leaves, then, leave it out to dry."]
